			"notes": "- Fixed second chat messages disappearing when switching servers on networks (e.g. going to spawn on SMPs)\n- Fixed deleted messages sometimes not being removed from the second chat\n- Invalid rules in the config file are now removed on startup instead of breaking filtering\n- Fixed potential crash when using the Jar on 26.2 versions\n\nYour support means a lot! If you'd like to help keep the project going, consider donating at:\n\nhttps://florianreuth.de/donate\n\nI'll continue improving this project to the best of my ability."
