			"notes": "- Reworked the UI\n- Added support for multiple chat windows\n  - Chats can now be repositioned freely\n  - Existing users will receive a default \"Chat 1\" setup with their previous rules and layout\n- Added per-server filtering (Also thanks to @weykn)\n- Fixed an issue where the second chat window could appear slightly off-screen by default\n- Fixed filtering not applying to messages with legacy color codes\n\nYour support means a lot! If you'd like to help keep the project going, consider donating at [https://florianreuth.de/donate](https://florianreuth.de/donate). I’ll continue improving this project to the best of my ability."
